## 2. Summary of Modified Files

| S.No | File Path | Type | Purpose of Change |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | `src/index.html` | Modified | Removed remote CDN script `https://cdn.ux4g.gov.in/tools/accessibility-widget.js` to enable 100% offline self-hosting. |
| 2 | `src/components/index.js` | Modified | Exported `AccessibilityWidget` component. |
| 3 | `src/components/TopHeader/index.js` | Modified | Rendered `<AccessibilityWidget />` and simplified `toggleUxgAccessibility` to toggle `#uw-main` drawer directly. |
| 4 | `src/components/SideMenu/styles.scss` | Modified | Anchored drawer to `bottom: 0 !important; height: auto !important;` with top offset `calc(var(--top-header-height, 0px) + --vih(64))` to prevent bottom clipping when zoomed; expanded mobile/tablet width with `--vih(125)` and added `white-space: nowrap`. |
| 5 | `src/components/Header/styles.scss` | Modified | Updated mobile and tablet drawer widths to `--vih(125) !important` to prevent menu label truncation. |
| 6 | `src/layouts/styles.scss` | Modified | Fixed double scrollbars by scaling layout height with dynamic CSS variable `calc(100vh / var(--app-zoom, 1))`. |
| 7 | `src/components/RightNav/index.js` | Modified | Attached `.right-nav__navItem-card--external` only to items navigating to external links (YouTube, Mailto, FAQs), keeping Customer Care and WhatsApp Chat unhighlighted. |
| 8 | `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/index.js` | New | Entry point for the accessibility widget. |
| 9 | `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/useAccessibilityManager.js` | New | Complete widget manager logic with self-contained HTML/CSS, dynamic `--app-zoom`, controlled `SPACING_LEVELS`, controlled `LINE_HEIGHT_LEVELS`, and intelligent Text-To-Speech with strict 'read-once' behavior. |
| 10 | `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/widgetStyles.scss` | New | Localized widget styling, high-contrast external link highlights (`#444701` and yellow outline), without turning normal/close buttons gray. |
| 11 | `ACCESSIBILITY_MIGRATION_STEPS.md` | New | Step-by-step branch migration and replication instructions. |

