## 4. Newly Created Files (`src/components/AccessibilityWidget/`)

### `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/index.js`
```javascript
import "./useAccessibilityManager";
import "./widgetStyles.scss";

export default function AccessibilityWidget() {
  return null;
}
```

### `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/useAccessibilityManager.js`
Contains:
- Self-contained widget DOM creation (zero remote CDN dependencies).
- App zoom calculations with dynamic `--app-zoom` variable.
- Controlled 3x text spacing array (`SPACING_LEVELS`).
- Controlled 4x line height progression (`LINE_HEIGHT_LEVELS`).
- Intelligent TTS element resolver (`resolveAccessibleElement`) with strict 'read-once' behavior and instant checkbox click feedback.

### `src/components/AccessibilityWidget/widgetStyles.scss`
Contains:
- Complete UX4G localized styling.
- External-only link highlights with dark olive background (`#444701`) and yellow outline (`yellow`).
- Neutral button isolation (no `background: revert`, preventing buttons and dialog close buttons from turning gray).
